<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatia</book>
  <para style="h">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatia</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, sawltah mihinga kipat a sawl hilou, mihing vang zong hilou in, Jesu Khrist leh Pa Pasian mishi lah akipata Ama Kaithoupa, vang a hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ka kunga um sanggamte zousie in, Galatia gam a um hattuomte kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Pasian leh i hundampa uh Jesu Khrist akipat, hepina leh hamuonna noute kungah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama pen Pasian leh i Pa uh deidan dungzuiin tulai gitlouna leitung a kipat ahing huhdoh theina dingin, ikhelnate ziehin, Ama leh Ama akipeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian kungah thupina kumtawn kumtawn in umdenta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist hepina a noute hing hanpa taisan a tukikaal a, khantanhoi tuom khat lam a na kiheisan pai uh lamdang ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuapen khantanhoi tuom ahi sih a, hinanleh noute hing subuoi in, Khrist khantanhoi a hiloulama heikawi ut mi pawlkhat a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh koute lah a mi nangawn hiin, van a kipat vansawlsiengte hitaleh, na kung ua ka gensa uh chilou khantanhoi dang mawngmawng na kung ua hing gen a um leh samsiet in um heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tumasang lai a ka gensa mabangun, tuin ka gen kia ahi; khantanhoi na pomsa uh chilou khantanhoi dang mi koipou in na kung ua ahing gen leh samsiet in um heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ken tuin mihing pahtat law sawm ka hiei, ahisihleh Pasian pahtat? Ahisihleh mihingte suhlungkim sawm ka hiei mah? Mihingte suhlungkim sawm ka hi nahlai leh, Khrist suoh ka hi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, ka khantanhoi gen khu mihing lam thu ahi sih chi ka hing thei sah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing a kipat ka mu ahi sih a, mihing hil zong ka hi sih hi, hinanleh Jesu Khrist kilahna zieh a ka mu ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Masanglai a Juda mite biehna dan ka zui lai a, ka hindan masa, bangchi banga Pasian hattuom te akaan avala bawl in suhmang ka tup dan, nouten na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ka pu leh pate thugousie a phattuom ka ngai seng ziehin, Juda mite biehna dan lam ah zong ka nampite lah a ka khanguol tampi sangin ka tallang zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh ka nu gilsunga ka umlai a pat a, hing na koituompa leh ahepina a hing hanpa Pasian in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentelte lah a Ama khantanhoi ka gen theina ding a, A Tapa keima a kilatsah pha asah laiin mihing koima toh ka kihou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo a, kei sanga sawltah na hi masate kungah zong ka haw tou sih a, Arabia gam ah ka pei zaw a, tuachi’n Damaska khuo ah ka hing kilekiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n kum thum nuain Peter toh kimu dingin Jerusalem ah ka haw tou a, ama kungah ni sawm leh ni nga ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa sanggampa Jakob chilou sawltah dangte khatbeh ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin na kung ua ka thu gelte tungtang ah Pasian mai ah, zuou ka gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zouin Siria leh Silisia gamkai sungah ka peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Khrist a um, Judia gam a hattuomten ahing melthei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh “Tumasanglai a eite hing bawlgentheipa’n, khat vei lai a asuhsiet sa ginna thu khu tuin atangkoupita,” chi thu bou aza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh amauten keima ziehin Pasian apahtawita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n kum sawm leh kum li nuain, Barnaba toh Jerusalem ah ka peitou kia ua, tualeh Tita zong ka pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilahna ka mu dungzuiin ka pei touta a, Jentelte kunga ka khantanhoi gen khu akung uah ka gensawn kia a, hinanleh mi zatat um deute pen atuom in ka hil hi, tuachilou in pen, amawhna a tai ka hi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kunga ka umpi Tita nangawn Greekmi hinapi teptan sah teitei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh tam teptan thupen Koite ahiei in atahtah hilou unaute ilah ua guhsima ahing puilut zieh ua hing um ahi. Amauten eite suoh ahing hi sah theina ding ua, Khrist Jesu a inoplenna nei uh guhsima hing enkhie ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khantanhoi thutah noute kunga a umden theina dingin naikal khat sung maimai zong amaute thunuoi ah ka kipelut vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh mi zatat um deu a kigente khu, bangchibang na hita u’leh zong, kei dingin bangma lamdanna anei sih a; Pasian in koima deisah tuom anei sih a, mi thupi deu a kigenten bangma ahing gen pieh tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Genpieh nahsangin, teptante dinga khantanhoi Peter kunga ngansie a aum bangin, teptanloute dinga khantanhoi ka tungah ngansie in a um chi athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen teptante sawltah hi dinga Peter guotpa ngelngel in, Jentelte kunga sawltah hi dingin keima zong ahing guot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh hattuom khuompi bang hiel a um, Jakob, Peter leh Johan in ka kunga hepina hing kipie athei bep un, koute gel Jentelte kunga pei dingin, tualeh amaute teptante kunga pei dingin, Kei leh Barnaba kipawlkhawmna khut zietlam ahing pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migentheite ka thei zing dinguh adei ua, tuapen ken zong bawl ka tup mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Antiok khuo a Peter ahing haw tahin amaitang ah kana phawhthop hi, aziehpen ama mawsah a umzieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakob akipat mi koite ahiei ahing haw masangun Jentelte kungah ann ane zel a, hinanleh amaute ahing haw tahun, teptante agiin ziehin anuatawn a aum tuomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judami dangten zong ama lepchie dan azui ua, Barnaba nangawn puimangin aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khantanhoi thutah toh kituohin aum sih uh chi ka mu tahin, Peter kungah, “Nang Juda mi hinapi a Judate um banga umlou a, Jentelte um banga na um ngal leh bang dinga Jentelte Judate tawndan zui sah na tup ahiei” chi’n amaute zousie mai ah ka phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eite pen Juda mi mawnga pieng i hi ua, Jentel mikhielte ihi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan nasepte ziehin mi siemtangin a um sih a, Jesu Khrist gintatna ziehin siemtangin a um uh chi ithei uhi, eiten zong dan sil bawlte zieh hilou a, Khrist ginna zieh a siemtanga i um theina dingin Khrist Jesu igingta uhi; aziehpen dan silte bawl ziehin koima siemtangin a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist a siemtanga um tum kawmpia eima ngel zong mikhielte ina hi leh, Khrist khu khelna nasempa hita ven izaw? Hi vawtlou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima’n ka suhsietsa silte bawlpha kiata leng, dan botsepa ka hi chi ka kilangsah giap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian lam a ka hin theina dingin kei pen dan ziehin dan lam ah ka shita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khrist toh kilbehin ka umta hi, hinanleh ka hing ahi, Keima hing hi nawnlouin, Khrist keima ah hing ahizaw hi; tua tahsa a ka hinna pen, Kei hing it a, kei a dinga hing kipumpiehpa Pasian Tapa ginna a hing ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ken Pasian hepina bangmalou ka suohsah sih hi, aziehpen dan zieh a siemtanna um hita leh Khrist athawn a shi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Galatia mimote aw, na mitmu ngel ua, na lah ua, Jesu Khrist khu killup ahi chi kichientahin alangta hi, tua thu khu zuilou dinga, koiin noute hing bum modoh ahi tai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute akipat tami thei ka ut hi, Dan zuina nasepte zieh a Hagau thu na nga uh ahiei, ahisihleh na thu zah uh na gintat zieh uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangdinga hichi mot talawm na hi uoi? Hagau thu a pan zouta ngal a, tahsa nasep a suhbukim sawm na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sil tuazapi amawhna a thuoh na hi uoi mah? Amawhna bang na hita leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kung ua Hagau hing pepa leh na lah ua sillamdang bawlpa in, dan nasepte ziehin ahiei abawl, ahisihleh na ngaikhiet ua na gintatna zieh uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham in Pasian agingta a, “Tua agintatna khu dihtatna a simpieh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin ginna nei mite khu Abraham tate ahi uh chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laisiengthouin, ginna ziehin Pasian in Jentelte siem atangsah ding chi mu masa in, Abraham kungah, “Nangma ah nam zousie guolzawl in a um ding uh,” chi’n khantanhoi ana gen masata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ginna neite pen miginum Abraham toh guolzawl khawm in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dan nasepte a kinga poumate pen gausapna nuoi a um ahi uh; “Aziehpen dan laibu sunga bawl dinga kigiel zousiete zui zinglou pouma gausapin um uheh” chi’n akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian mai ah koima dan a siemtang a um sih uh chi akichien hi, “Aziehpen mi dihtat ginna in ahing ding,” chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh dan pen ginna ah akinga sih a, “Tuanahsangin tuabang bawl mite pen tuate ah ahing ding hi,” chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist khu eite sih leh taanga sapsiet a hing um in, dan sapsietna akipat in ahing tandohta hi; aziehpen “Tambangin akigiel hi, Singdawn a khailup pouma sapsietna thuoh ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuapen Abraham tunga guolzawlna khu, Khrist Jesu zieh a Jentelte tunga ahing tun theina ding leh eiten ginna zieh a, Pasian chiemsa Hagau i nga theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaute aw, mihing dan in ka gen ahi, tam pen mihing thuhun hitamananleh, akinamdet tah chiengin, Koiman aphel ngai sih a, belap zong akibelap ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin Abraham leh ahahasuonte kungah, thuchiemte a pie hi. Aman mi tampite gen bangin, “Nahahlesuonte” kungah achi sih a, “Mi khat gen in nahahlesuon” kungah, achi zaw hi, tua khu Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh tami ka gen ahi, Pasian in Khrist a asuhdetsa thuhun khu kum zali leh kum sawm thum nua a hing um danin thuchiem khu aphietmang thei sih a, bangmalou suo dingin asumang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gouluona pen dan a kinga hileh pen, thuchiem a kinga ahi sih ding hi; hinanleh Pasian in gouluonapen thuchiem ziehin Abraham kungah ana peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahileh dan in atup bang hi ding ahiei leh? Tam pen hahlesuon, akunga thuchiem pieh a umpa ahing pei masangsie bawsietna ziehin belapin a um a, vansawlsiengte zanga palai khuta pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin palai pen mi khat guoh palai ahi sih a, hinanleh Pasian pen khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahileh dan khu Pasian thuchiem kal ahiei mah? Kal vawtlou, hinna pe thei dan ana kipie hitaleh siemtansahna khu dan ziehin ana umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Laisiengthou in sil zousie khelna thuneina nuoi ah akhahkhum ta hi, tua pen agingtate kunga Jesu Khrist gintatna zieh a tua thuchiem atangtun sah theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ginna ahing tun masangin dan nuoi a kepin ina um a, ahing kilang ding ginna ah khahkhum in ina um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin dan khu ginna zieh a siem itan theina ding ua, Khrist kunga hing pui dinga eite hing hilpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh ginna ahing tun nuain, eite hing hilpa nuoi ah i um nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen na unpi un Khrist Jesu ginna ziehin Pasian tate na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen na lah ua Khrist a baptisma tang pouma pen Khrist a kivon na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuanah Juda leh Greek a um nawn sih a, sila leh zalen a um nawn sih a, tualeh numei leh pasal zong a um nawn sih hi, aziehpen noute na unpi un Khrist Jesu ah pumkhat na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Khrist a na hi taah u’leh Abraham hahlesuon, thuchiem dungzui a gouluo dingte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka gen khu tami ahi, gouluo dingpa pen bangkim neipa hinapiin naupang ahi laisie suoh toh kilamdanna anei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Apa hun guot atun masangsie’n, ama don mite leh kem mite thunuoi ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabangma in eite zong naupang ihi lai in leitung thubul kihilnate ah koltangin ina um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh ahun guot bukim tah a ahing tun tah in, Pasian in A Tapa ang sawl a, Ama dan nuoi ah numei akipat ahing pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ta hina itan theina dinga, dan nuoi a umte hing tandoh ding in, Pasian in ahing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tate na hi zieh un, Pasian in a Tapa Hagau khu na lungtang sung uah ahing sawl a tua Hagau khu Abba Pa chia kikou khepa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute suoh na hi nawnta sih ua; ta na hita uhi, tualeh a ta na hileh, Khrist zal a Pasian gouluopa ding zong na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian na theilou lai un, piendan mawnga pasien hiloute nasem in na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh tu a Pasian na hing thei nua ua ahisihleh Pasian in ahing thei mi na hizaw nua ua, bangdinga thubul zawngkhal leh panna beite suoh a lutkia ut a, kilehei kia na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nite, hate, hunte leh kumte na tang zel ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tung ua ka sepgimna athawn ahi khah ding ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute aw ka hing ngen ahi, keima bangin um un, Kei zong nouma bangin ka um hi, ka tungah bawlkhiel na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kung ua khantanhoi ka gen masahna pen khu tahsa hatlouna zieh ahi chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tahsa a dammawna pen, kei a dinga hasatna hinanleh na simmaw sih ua, nuol zong nahing nuol sih uhi, hinanleh Pasian vansawlsieng bang leh Jesu Khrist bang khopin na hing pom zaw u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahileh vangpha na kisahna uh uh bang suoh atai leh? Hithei hileh na mittangte nangawn uh kheikhie in kei na hing pe nuom ding uh chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thutah ka hing hil zieh a, na melma uh hing hita ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amauten phatuom ngaitahin noute ahing sui ua, tuakhu ahoilam ahi sih hi, nouten amaute na sui theina ding ua, ahing puse sawm ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh bangchihlaipouin sil hoi phatuomngaitah a sui zing a um ahoi hi, na kung ua ka um sung guoh hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ta deitahte aw, nouma a Khrist siem pichinga aum masangsie’n nau suoh nat vei in ka hing vei kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tumama in noute kungah um in, ka aw suoh heng thei leng ut va-ia tei ing e, na tung thu uh ka hing lunggimpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hing hil vawi un, nou dan nuoia um utte, danthu ngaikhe lou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen tambangin ana kigiel hi: Abraham in tapa ni anei a, khat khu suohnu akipat ahia, adangkhat pen noplen nu a pata pieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Suohnu apata pieng tapa pen tahsa dan a pieng ahi a, noplennu akipat a pieng tapa pen thuchiem zieh a pieng, thuchiem tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam thute etsahna nei ahi uhi. Tam numei nite khu thuhun nite ahi uhi, khat pen Sinai muol apat saltang dinga ta neinu ahia, tua khu Hagar ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hagar pen Arabia gam a Sinai muol etsahna ahia, ama tulai a Jerusalem a um atate toh sal taangkhawm kigenna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh tunglam Jerusalem pen a noplen a, tuakhu eite zousie nu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen: “Nang ta neilou a chiing nu, nuom in, Nang nauvei natna thuohlou nu, kikoukhiein, pasal neinu sangin lungzuong nu’n, ta tampi anei zaw hi” chi’n akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n unaute eite pen Isaak banga thuchiem tate ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh khum hun lai a tahsa dan a pieng tapa in, Hagau dan a pieng tapa abawlsiet bangin tuin zong tuabang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahivang in Laisiengthouin bang agen ei? “Suohnu pen atapa toh notmang un, suohnu tapa in noplen nu tapa toh gou aluokhawm sih ding hi,” chi’n akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute eite pen suohnu tate ihi sih ua, noplen nu tate ihizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin suoh hi nawnlou dingin Khrist in eite ahing zalen sahta hi, tuachi’n dingdet unlen suoh hahkol ah awhkia nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai un Kei Paul in na kung uah ka gen hi, tep na tan laisie uh Khrist noute adingin bangma phatuom lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teptante zousie kungah, dan zousie zui ding na bat ahi, chi ka hing theisah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dan zieh a siemtansahna nga tum noute, Khrist toh na kikhenta ua, hepina na puasanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh kouten Hagau ziehin ginna a siemtanna kinepna khu thanuom tahin ka ngah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesu Khrist ah teptan leh teptan louin bangma phattuomna anei sih hi, hinanleh itna zieh a sep ginna khu aphatuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hoitahin na tai uhi, thutah zuina a kipat noute hing dal koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam banga kizawllungdamna pen noute hing hanpa a kipat ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tol tawmnoukhat in tanghou pheng pumpi athousah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nouten lungsim dang nei sih va uteh chi Mangpa ah ka hing muong hi, hinanleh koi hinanleh noute hing subuoi mi in thukhenna athuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, ken teptan thu gen nalai ka hileh bang zieh a bawlsietna thuoh nalai ka diei? Tuachi ahileh Kross a kipalpuana khu suhbei ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noute hing subuoite ama uleh amauh kisatkhe vanglah u’leh ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, noute zalen dinga hat na hi uhi, na zalenna uh pen tahsa dinga lemtannain zang sih unlen, itnain khat leh khat nna kisep pieh zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen “Nangma na ki it bangin, na innvengte na it ding ahi,” chi thuteng khatah dan zousie suhbukim in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh noute khat leh khat na kikeituo ua, na kinehtuo u’leh na kisuhmang louna dingun pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami ka gen ahi, Hagau ah um un, tuachi’n na tahsa utna uh na sutangtung sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsain Hagau adou a, Hagau in tahsa a dou hi sil nabawl tupte uh nabawl theilouna dingun, tamte gel akikaltuo zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Hagau pui a na um u’leh, dan nuoia um na hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin tahsa silbawlte akilang chien hi, tuate pen tamte ahi; angkawmna, kingaina, thanghuoina, sienthoulouna, numei pasal kaal a pahtatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milimbiehna, bumna, kimudana, kihauna, thangsietna, lungthahna, kilangbawlna, huoihamna, kiselna, gintuomna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Deigawna, tuolthana, zukhamna, uongtatna leh tambang gamtatna dangdangte ahi, tambang a um miten Pasian gam aluo sih ding uhi, chia masang laia ka hing hil tah mabangin, ka hing hil khol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hagau gate ahileh, Itna, kipahna, lungmuonna, thuohhatna, zainemna, hoina, ginumna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thunuoilutna, kidehtheina, ahi, tambangte toh kikal dan a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Khrist a hita miten tahsa a a utnate u’leh adeigaw leh lunggulnate u’toh akilbehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hagau a hing ihi u’leh Hagau ma ah i um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khat leh khat kilangbawl leh kithangsiet in um sih vai in, amawh a kithupisah itum sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, mi koi ahiei khat atatkhelzieha mat a aum leh nou Hagau miten, nangma zong solna na tuoh khah ding ngaituoin tuabang mi khu nun nemtahin tungding kia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khat leh khat na puohgihte uh kidawn chiet un, tuachi’n Khrist dan zuikim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi koipou bangma hilou napi a, ama leh ama akingai sang leh ama leh ama kisol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Michin in ama nasep ki etchien chiet zaw heh, tuachi’n midang tung ah hilou in, ama tungah akisiel thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen mi chinin ama puoh chiet akipuoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu hil a umpa in ahilpa kung ah silhoi pe phal heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sol in umsih un, Pasian pen simmaw guol ahi sih hi, aziehpen mi’n atu phot uh tua ma a at ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa lam a tu miin tahsa lam a sietna a at dinga, hinanleh Hagau lam a tu miin Hagau a kumtawn hinna a at ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n silhoi bawl chimtah sih va ui, ilungkieh sih nah pouleh ahun tahin i at ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin hunlemtaang inei bang zelin mi zousie kungah silhoi bawl va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima khut ngel a na kung ua, lai teng lienpi a ka hing gel en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tahsalam a mite pahtat lunggul miten teptan dingin noute ahing sawl teitei uhi, bangdang zieh hilouin, amauten Khrist Kross zieh a, bawlsietna athuoh louna ding un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Teptante nangawn in Dan azui sih uhi. Hinanleh amauten na tahsa tung ua akisiel nop man ua teptan dinga noute ang dei uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken vang i Mangpa Khrist Kross loungal ka suong sih ding hi, Ama ziehin leitung kei ding in kilbeh ahita a, Kei leitunga dingin kilbeh ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrist Jesu ah pen siemtana loungal, teptan bangma aphattuom sih a, teptanlou zong bangma aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam dan zui mi zousiete tungah lungmuonna leh hepina umta hen, Israelte Pasian tung ah zong um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua kipat in koiman hing subuoi nawn sih heh, aziehpen ka tahsa ah Mangpa Jesu chiemtena ka puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaute aw, i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina khu noute kungah umta hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
